  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development by reason of the flat roof side dormers would add excessive massing, represents poor design and an incongruous and dominating addition to the host property failing to reserve or enhance the conservation area. As such, the development is contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021), Policy DM1 and DM7 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
